    <h2>The Double Cheeseburger: Pure Beef Balance Without the Gimmicks</h2>
  <p>For diners who love classic drive-thru burger architecture but find single-patty options wanting, the Double Cheeseburger strikes the definitive sweet spot. Rather than overcomplicating things with specialty aiolis or bacon jams, it doubles down on the essentials: two savory, seasoned beef patties flanked by melted cheese and the tart snap of pickles and mustard. It provides a substantial upgrade over the single <a href="/items/original-cheeseburger">Original Cheeseburger</a> without crossing into the $10+ territory of specialty Stackburgers. Explore the entire savory lineup on <a href="/">The Queen Dairy Menu</a>.</p>

  <h2>Original vs. Double vs. Stackburger — The Complete Burger Comparison</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap"><table class="size-table"><thead><tr><th>Burger</th><th>Price</th><th>Calories</th><th>Best For</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Original Cheeseburger</td><td class="price-cell">$6.39</td><td>400 cal</td><td>Best value — $7 Meal Deal eligible</td></tr><tr><td>Double Cheeseburger</td><td class="price-cell">$7.99</td><td>560 cal</td><td>More beef, same toppings — for hungry guests</td></tr><tr><td>Two Cheese Deluxe Stackburger</td><td class="price-cell">$8.29</td><td>630 cal</td><td>Premium cheese, more toppings</td></tr><tr><td>Backyard Bacon Ranch Stackburger</td><td class="price-cell">$9.99</td><td>730 cal</td><td>Bacon + ranch — Stackburger tier</td></tr><tr><td>FlameThrower® Stackburger</td><td class="price-cell">$10.87</td><td>780 cal</td><td>Most premium, spicy</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

  <h2>Ideal Scenarios for Ordering the Double Cheeseburger</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>High-Protein Fuel:</strong> Delivering an impressive 34 grams of protein at 560 calories, it fuels active afternoons without unnecessary carbohydrate bloat.</li>
    <li><strong>Smart Budget Upgrade:</strong> At $7.99, it offers twice the seared beef for just $1.60 more than the single Original Cheeseburger.</li>
    <li><strong>Purist Diner Flavor:</strong> Ideal for burger fans who appreciate traditional diner seasoning—sharp mustard, dill pickle brine, and melted American cheese—without sweet BBQ or spicy jalapeño sauces.</li>
    <li><strong>Shareable Family Lunches:</strong> Easily sliced or paired with an extra side of fries to feed two kids or satisfy a hearty lunch appetite on the go.</li>
  </ul>

